      "sample_index": 0,
      "text": "To determine how many minutes it will take for the printer to print 200 pages, we start by noting the printer's printing rate of 17 pages per minute. We need to find out how many minutes, \\( t \\), it takes to print 200 pages. This can be set up as a division problem:\n\n\\[\nt = \\frac{\\text{Total number of pages}}{\\text{Printing rate}} = \\frac{200 \\text{ pages}}{17 \\text{ pages per minute}}\n\\]\n\nNext, we perform the division:\n\n\\[\nt = \\frac{200}{17} \\approx 11.7647\n\\]\n\nSince we need to express the answer to the nearest whole number, we round 11.7647 to the nearest whole number, which is 12. Therefore, it will take approximately 12 minutes to print 200 pages.\n\nThe final answer is:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{12}\n\\]",
